# Cloudflare Wrangler & Workers AI Integration Plan

Integrate **Cloudflare Workers AI** (Llama 3.1 8B Instruct model) and **Wrangler CLI** into the PulseOdds Sports Screener app to provide real-time AI-powered odds analysis, risk assessments, and betting recommendations.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Offline-First Architectural Guarantee**: All core Offline Master Model calculations (Confluence Ledger, 4-Profile Engine, MEG/MET metrics, 5-lamp confidence scoring, pick rankings) run 100% locally in JavaScript/TypeScript without needing an internet connection. Cloudflare Workers AI operates exclusively as an **Online AI Copilot** when the user is connected to the network.

